      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm prepping a script for my tech podcast. Can you give me a list of the most compelling reasons why the 'Right to Repair' movement is a necessary fight against corporate monopolies? I want to really hammer home why consumers are being screwed over by these big tech companies.",
