      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the intro. To make the episode really punchy, I also need to address the usual excuses these companies use. They always claim they're just \"protecting security\" or \"protecting intellectual property\" to stop people from fixing stuff. How can I frame those arguments as just being excuses to keep their monopolies going?",
